      "body_html": "<p>Morning routine: <strong>Je me leve</strong> (I get up). <strong>Je me lave</strong> (I wash). <strong>Je m'habille</strong> (I get dressed). These are <strong>reflexive</strong> verbs — action on yourself.</p>"
